IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P6-art-50`

-- P6-tests-art-50: tests of Article 50, written from the text. The expected value is written beside each assertion and was decided from the text before the run.
-- Article 50 is in the group General: it applies from 2 August 2026 (Art 113 second paragraph). Each function is tested the day before, on the first day, and later;
-- the text's branches; the saving of Art 111(2) for a legacy high-risk system; and, for the two-text provisions, each side of 27 July 2026.

§ `Dates and systems used in the tests`

`Art 50 test the day before the group applies` MEANS Date 1 8 2026
`Art 50 test the first day the group applies` MEANS Date 2 8 2026
`Art 50 test a later day` MEANS Date 1 3 2027

-- An AI system that is not high-risk, placed on the market on 1 January 2026 (before the group applies).
`Art 50 test system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2026
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

-- A high-risk system (Article 6(2) and Annex III) placed on 1 January 2027, before 2 December 2027 (Chapter III applies to it from then): Art 111(2) saves it unless its design is significantly changed.
`Art 50 test legacy high-risk system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`Art 50 test changed legacy high-risk system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE

-- A system placed on the market on 2 August 2026 or later (Art 111(4) gives no extra time).
`Art 50 test system placed after the group applies` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 8 2026
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

§ `The group General (Art 113) as Article 50 asks it`

#ASSERT NOT (`Art 50 the group General applies on the date asked` `Art 50 test the day before the group applies`)
#ASSERT `Art 50 the group General applies on the date asked` `Art 50 test the first day the group applies`
#ASSERT `Art 50 the group General applies on the date asked` `Art 50 test a later day`
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 50 the group General applies to the AI system on the date asked` `Art 50 test the day before the group applies` `Art 50 test system`)
#ASSERT `Art 50 the group General applies to the AI system on the date asked` `Art 50 test the first day the group applies` `Art 50 test system`
-- Art 111(2): the legacy high-risk system is saved; changed in its design, it is not.
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 50 the group General applies to the AI system on the date asked` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test legacy high-risk system`)
#ASSERT `Art 50 the group General applies to the AI system on the date asked` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test changed legacy high-risk system`

§ `Article 50(1): AI systems intended to interact directly with natural persons`

-- args: date asked, system, intended to interact directly, obvious to a reasonably well-informed person, authorised by law, safeguards, available for the public to report a criminal offence
-- The day before the group applies, on its first day and later.
#ASSERT `Art 50(1) the provider must ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed that they are interacting with an AI system` `Art 50 test the day before the group applies` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 50(1) the provider must ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed that they are interacting with an AI system` `Art 50 test the first day the group applies` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(1) the provider must ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed that they are interacting with an AI system` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not a system intended to interact directly with natural persons: the paragraph does not speak to it.
#ASSERT `Art 50(1) the provider must ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed that they are interacting with an AI system` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- "unless this is obvious from the point of view of a natural person who is reasonably well-informed ..."
#ASSERT `Art 50(1) the provider must ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed that they are interacting with an AI system` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The law-enforcement exception: authorised by law, subject to safeguards, not available for the public to report a criminal offence.
#ASSERT `Art 50(1) the provider must ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed that they are interacting with an AI system` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- "unless those systems are available for the public to report a criminal offence": then the obligation applies.
#ASSERT `Art 50(1) the provider must ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed that they are interacting with an AI system` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Authorised by law but not subject to safeguards (fork F-50-1-safeguards): the exception is not made out, so the obligation applies.
#ASSERT `Art 50(1) the provider must ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed that they are interacting with an AI system` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not authorised by law: safeguards alone do not make the exception.
#ASSERT `Art 50(1) the provider must ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed that they are interacting with an AI system` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Art 111(2): the legacy high-risk system is saved; changed in its design, the paragraph applies.
#ASSERT `Art 50(1) the provider must ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed that they are interacting with an AI system` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test legacy high-risk system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 50(1) the provider must ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed that they are interacting with an AI system` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test changed legacy high-risk system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- The rule (day 0 is the day of the first interaction; Art 50(5): "at the latest at the time of the first interaction or exposure").
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 50(1) the provider's duty to ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 50(1) ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed that they are interacting with an AI system` AT 0
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 50(1) the provider's duty to ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 50(1) ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed that they are interacting with an AI system` AT 1
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 50(1) the provider's duty to ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 1
-- The obvious case: nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 50(1) the provider's duty to ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 30
-- The day before the group applies: nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 50(1) the provider's duty to ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed` `Art 50 test the day before the group applies` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 30
-- Saved by Art 111(2): nothing is owed; changed in its design, the missed time is a breach.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 50(1) the provider's duty to ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test legacy high-risk system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 30
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 50(1) the provider's duty to ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test changed legacy high-risk system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 30

§ `Article 50(2): synthetic audio, image, video or text content (with Art 111(4))`

-- args: date asked, system, generates synthetic content, assistive function for standard editing, does not substantially alter the input, authorised by law
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the provider must ensure that the outputs of the AI system are marked in a machine-readable format and detectable as artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test the day before the group applies` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- A system placed on the market on 1 January 2026 (before 2 August 2026): Art 111(4) gives it until 2 December 2026. The first day of the group is inside that time.
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the provider must ensure that the outputs of the AI system are marked in a machine-readable format and detectable as artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test the first day the group applies` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the provider must ensure that the outputs of the AI system are marked in a machine-readable format and detectable as artificially generated or manipulated` (Date 1 12 2026) `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the provider must ensure that the outputs of the AI system are marked in a machine-readable format and detectable as artificially generated or manipulated` (Date 2 12 2026) `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the provider must ensure that the outputs of the AI system are marked in a machine-readable format and detectable as artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A system placed on the market on 2 August 2026: no extra time (Art 111(4) reaches systems placed "before 2 August 2026").
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the provider must ensure that the outputs of the AI system are marked in a machine-readable format and detectable as artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test the first day the group applies` `Art 50 test system placed after the group applies` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not a system generating synthetic content; the exceptions; the saved legacy system.
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the provider must ensure that the outputs of the AI system are marked in a machine-readable format and detectable as artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the provider must ensure that the outputs of the AI system are marked in a machine-readable format and detectable as artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the provider must ensure that the outputs of the AI system are marked in a machine-readable format and detectable as artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the provider must ensure that the outputs of the AI system are marked in a machine-readable format and detectable as artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the provider must ensure that the outputs of the AI system are marked in a machine-readable format and detectable as artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test legacy high-risk system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the provider must ensure that the outputs of the AI system are marked in a machine-readable format and detectable as artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test changed legacy high-risk system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- Art 111(4) as a date: the helper is true from 2 December 2026 for a system placed before 2 August 2026, and from the start for one placed later.
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 50(2) the date for compliance under Article 111(4) has come` (Date 1 12 2026) `Art 50 test system` TRUE)
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the date for compliance under Article 111(4) has come` (Date 2 12 2026) `Art 50 test system` TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the date for compliance under Article 111(4) has come` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 50 test system placed after the group applies` TRUE
-- A system that does not generate synthetic content has no Art 111(4) date.
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the date for compliance under Article 111(4) has come` (Date 1 9 2026) `Art 50 test system` FALSE

-- args: date asked, system, marked in a machine-readable format, detectable, effective, interoperable, robust, reliable
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the marking of the outputs and the technical solutions are what paragraph 2 requires` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the marking of the outputs and the technical solutions are what paragraph 2 requires` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the marking of the outputs and the technical solutions are what paragraph 2 requires` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the marking of the outputs and the technical solutions are what paragraph 2 requires` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the marking of the outputs and the technical solutions are what paragraph 2 requires` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the marking of the outputs and the technical solutions are what paragraph 2 requires` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the marking of the outputs and the technical solutions are what paragraph 2 requires` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 50(2) the marking of the outputs and the technical solutions are what paragraph 2 requires` `Art 50 test the day before the group applies` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- The rule has no time limit and no consequence: acting reads FULFILLED, and waiting leaves the duty standing (no breach path).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 50(2) the provider's duty to ensure that the outputs are marked and detectable` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 50(2) ensure that the outputs of the AI system are marked in a machine-readable format and detectable as artificially generated or manipulated` AT 400
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 50(2) the provider's duty to ensure that the outputs are marked and detectable` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 50(2) the provider's duty to ensure that the outputs are marked and detectable` `Art 50 test the day before the group applies` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400

§ `Article 50(3): emotion recognition systems and biometric categorisation systems`

-- args: date asked, system, emotion recognition system, biometric categorisation system, used ... permitted by law, safeguards, in accordance with Union law
#ASSERT `Art 50(3) the deployer must inform the natural persons exposed to the operation of the system` `Art 50 test the day before the group applies` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 50(3) the deployer must inform the natural persons exposed to the operation of the system` `Art 50 test the first day the group applies` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(3) the deployer must inform the natural persons exposed to the operation of the system` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(3) the deployer must inform the natural persons exposed to the operation of the system` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The exception needs all three: permitted by law, subject to safeguards, in accordance with Union law.
#ASSERT `Art 50(3) the deployer must inform the natural persons exposed to the operation of the system` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 50(3) the deployer must inform the natural persons exposed to the operation of the system` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(3) the deployer must inform the natural persons exposed to the operation of the system` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(3) the deployer must inform the natural persons exposed to the operation of the system` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- args: date asked, system, emotion recognition system, biometric categorisation system
#ASSERT `Art 50(3) the deployer must process the personal data in accordance with Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680, as applicable` `Art 50 test the day before the group applies` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 50(3) the deployer must process the personal data in accordance with Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680, as applicable` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(3) the deployer must process the personal data in accordance with Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680, as applicable` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(3) the deployer must process the personal data in accordance with Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680, as applicable` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 50(3) the deployer's duty to inform the natural persons exposed` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Deployer DOES `Art 50(3) inform the natural persons exposed to the operation of the system` AT 0
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 50(3) the deployer's duty to inform the natural persons exposed` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Deployer DOES `Art 50(3) inform the natural persons exposed to the operation of the system` AT 1
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 50(3) the deployer's duty to inform the natural persons exposed` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 2
-- The law-enforcement exception: nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 50(3) the deployer's duty to inform the natural persons exposed` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 2
-- The duty to process the personal data lawfully has no time limit and no consequence: acting reads FULFILLED, waiting leaves it standing.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 50(3) the deployer's duty to process the personal data in accordance with the data protection instruments` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Deployer DOES `Art 50(3) process the personal data in accordance with the data protection instruments` AT 3
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 50(3) the deployer's duty to process the personal data in accordance with the data protection instruments` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400

§ `Article 50(4), first subparagraph: deep fakes`

-- args: date asked, system, generates or manipulates image/audio/video content, the content constitutes a deep fake, authorised by law
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer must disclose that the content has been artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test the day before the group applies` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer must disclose that the content has been artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test the first day the group applies` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer must disclose that the content has been artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer must disclose that the content has been artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer must disclose that the content has been artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
