#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the transparency obligations are limited to disclosure of the existence of the generated or manipulated content` `Art 50 test the day before the group applies` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the transparency obligations are limited to disclosure of the existence of the generated or manipulated content` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the transparency obligations are limited to disclosure of the existence of the generated or manipulated content` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- args: date asked, system, artistic work, disclosed, disclosure in an appropriate manner
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer's disclosure is what the first subparagraph requires` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer's disclosure is what the first subparagraph requires` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer's disclosure is what the first subparagraph requires` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer's disclosure is what the first subparagraph requires` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer's disclosure is what the first subparagraph requires` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer's disclosure is what the first subparagraph requires` `Art 50 test the day before the group applies` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 50(4) the deployer's duty to disclose that the content has been artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Deployer DOES `Art 50(4) disclose that the content has been artificially generated or manipulated` AT 0
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 50(4) the deployer's duty to disclose that the content has been artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Deployer DOES `Art 50(4) disclose that the content has been artificially generated or manipulated` AT 1
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 50(4) the deployer's duty to disclose that the content has been artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 1
-- Authorised by law: nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 50(4) the deployer's duty to disclose that the content has been artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 30

§ `Article 50(4), second subparagraph: text published to inform the public`

-- args: date asked, system, generates or manipulates text, published to inform the public on matters of public interest, authorised by law, human review or editorial control, editorial responsibility
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer must disclose that the text has been artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test the day before the group applies` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer must disclose that the text has been artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test the first day the group applies` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer must disclose that the text has been artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer must disclose that the text has been artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer must disclose that the text has been artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Human review or editorial control AND editorial responsibility: the exception. Either alone does not make it.
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer must disclose that the text has been artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer must disclose that the text has been artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(4) the deployer must disclose that the text has been artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
