-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 50(4) the deployer's duty to disclose that the text has been artificially generated or manipulated` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
