    WAITUNTIL 30

§ `Article 50(5): when and how the information is provided`

-- args: date asked, system, the paragraph the information is referred to in, date the information was provided, date of the first interaction or exposure, clear and distinguishable
#ASSERT `Art 50(5) the information was provided in a clear and distinguishable manner at the latest at the time of the first interaction or exposure` `Art 50 test the day before the group applies` `Art 50 test system` 1 (Date 5 3 2027) (Date 5 3 2027) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 50(5) the information was provided in a clear and distinguishable manner at the latest at the time of the first interaction or exposure` `Art 50 test the first day the group applies` `Art 50 test system` 1 (Date 5 3 2027) (Date 5 3 2027) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- On the day of the first interaction is in time ("at the latest at the time of"); the day after is not.
#ASSERT `Art 50(5) the information was provided in a clear and distinguishable manner at the latest at the time of the first interaction or exposure` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` 1 (Date 5 3 2027) (Date 5 3 2027) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(5) the information was provided in a clear and distinguishable manner at the latest at the time of the first interaction or exposure` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` 1 (Date 4 3 2027) (Date 5 3 2027) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(5) the information was provided in a clear and distinguishable manner at the latest at the time of the first interaction or exposure` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` 1 (Date 6 3 2027) (Date 5 3 2027) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 50(5) the information was provided in a clear and distinguishable manner at the latest at the time of the first interaction or exposure` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` 3 (Date 5 3 2027) (Date 5 3 2027) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Paragraphs 1 to 4 only.
#ASSERT `Art 50(5) the information was provided in a clear and distinguishable manner at the latest at the time of the first interaction or exposure` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` 4 (Date 5 3 2027) (Date 5 3 2027) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 50(5) the information was provided in a clear and distinguishable manner at the latest at the time of the first interaction or exposure` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` 0 (Date 5 3 2027) (Date 5 3 2027) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 50(5) the information was provided in a clear and distinguishable manner at the latest at the time of the first interaction or exposure` `Art 50 test a later day` `Art 50 test system` 5 (Date 5 3 2027) (Date 5 3 2027) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked, system, conforms to the applicable accessibility requirements
#ASSERT `Art 50(5) the information conforms to the applicable accessibility requirements` `Art 50 test the day before the group applies` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 50(5) the information conforms to the applicable accessibility requirements` `Art 50 test the first day the group applies` `Art 50 test system` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
