§ `Seam S14: Article 2(2) and Article 50`

-- Seam S14 (PLAN.md section 4). Article 2(2) lists the provisions that apply to an AI system classified as high-risk under Article 6(1) and related to products covered by the Section B legislation:
-- Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112 (as amended); Article 6(1), Articles 102 to 109 and Article 112 (as enacted). Article 50 is on neither list.
-- The keel's function answers JUST FALSE for every paragraph of Article 50 in that case, NOTHING where the route is not Article 6(1) or the products are not Section B products.
-- The expected values were decided from Article 2(2) and the rule of the plan (JUST FALSE there; the function's own provision otherwise) before the run.

-- The systems. Both are high-risk under Article 6(1) with Annex I; the first was placed before Chapter III applies to it but has been significantly changed in its design since (so Art 111(2) does not save it), the second has not been changed (so Art 111(2) saves it).
`Art 50 test Section B system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2026
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE

`Art 50 test legacy Section B system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2026
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`Art 50 test reference to Article 50 paragraph 0` MEANS `Article reference` WITH
    `number` IS 50
    `letter` IS ""
    `paragraph` IS 0

`Art 50 test reference to Article 50 paragraph 1` MEANS `Article reference` WITH
    `number` IS 50
    `letter` IS ""
    `paragraph` IS 1

`Art 50 test reference to Article 50 paragraph 2` MEANS `Article reference` WITH
    `number` IS 50
    `letter` IS ""
    `paragraph` IS 2

`Art 50 test reference to Article 50 paragraph 3` MEANS `Article reference` WITH
    `number` IS 50
    `letter` IS ""
    `paragraph` IS 3

`Art 50 test reference to Article 50 paragraph 4` MEANS `Article reference` WITH
    `number` IS 50
    `letter` IS ""
    `paragraph` IS 4

`Art 50 test reference to Article 50 paragraph 5` MEANS `Article reference` WITH
    `number` IS 50
    `letter` IS ""
    `paragraph` IS 5

`Art 50 test reference to Article 60a` MEANS `Article reference` WITH
    `number` IS 60
    `letter` IS "a"
    `paragraph` IS 0

`Art 50 test reference to Article 102` MEANS `Article reference` WITH
    `number` IS 102
    `letter` IS ""
    `paragraph` IS 0

`Art 50 test reference to Article 57` MEANS `Article reference` WITH
    `number` IS 57
    `letter` IS ""
    `paragraph` IS 0

